  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut zucchini and carrot into bite-sized pieces. Slice brown onion into wedges.\n• Place zucchini, carrot and onion on the lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6413e0ac9dcce08f4304f318/step-9852feba.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a large saucepan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Stir in the butter, tomato paste and garlic seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add the water, vegetable stock powder and risoni. Bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to medium and cook until risoni is ‘al dente’, 10-12 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6413e0ac9dcce08f4304f318/step-a28355a4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir the roasted veggies, baby spinach and cheese through the risoni.\n• Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6413e0ac9dcce08f4304f318/step-1f214369.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide risoni between bowls.\n• Top with basil pesto to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6413e0ac9dcce08f4304f318/step-1d397e25.jpg"
    }
  ]
